#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!meta title=\"Shutting down Tails\"]]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid "There are 2 ways of shutting down Tails."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!toc startlevel=2]]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With both techniques, all the data stored in [[!wikipedia Random-access_memory\n"
"desc=\"RAM\"]] is securely erased to protect you from [[cold boot\n"
"attacks|doc/advanced_topics/cold_boot_attacks]].\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<h2 id=\"standard\">Standard shutdown from the system menu</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"The standard shutdown procedure is slower, but prevents damage to your "
"Persistent Storage and data loss."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid "Open the system menu in the upper-right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   [[!img desktop/system-with-wifi-only.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid ""
"Select [[!img lib/system-shutdown.png link=\"no\" class=\"symbolic\" "
"alt=\"Power Off\"]]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid "Select **Power Off**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid "A **Power Off** confirmation dialog appears."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   [[!img power_off_without_inhibitor.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   If an application needs to be closed or an open document needs to be saved\n"
"   before shutting down, the dialog includes some details.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   [[!img power_off_with_inhibitor.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid "Select the **Power Off** button to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Even without confirming or saving the open documents, Tails will shut down\n"
"   after 60 seconds.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<h2 id=\"emergency\">Emergency shutdown</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"To trigger an emergency shutdown, unplug the USB stick or eject the DVD from "
"which Tails is running. Doing so might be faster than shutting down from the "
"system menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<div class=\"caution\">\n"
msgstr "<div class=\"caution\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<p>You risk breaking your Persistent Storage and losing data when you unplug\n"
"your USB stick while Tails is running.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<p>If you use a Persistent Storage, only unplug your Tails USB stick in an\n"
"emergency.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</div>\n"
msgstr "</div>\n"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "  <div class=\"caution\">\n"
#~ msgstr "  <div class=\"caution\">\n"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "  </div>\n"
#~ msgstr "  </div>\n"
